 "name_en": "Supplier Consignment (2LG)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Supplier Consignment (2LG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">By using the consignment process for procurement, the supplier provides the material and stores it at site of the procuring party. The supplier maintains the legal owner of the material until it is withdrawn from the consignment stores. Payment for consignment stock is only required in case the material is withdrawn. For this reason, the supplier is informed of withdrawals of consignment stock on a regular basis.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage purchase orders</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage goods receipts</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage stock</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Settle consignment</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Store supplier goods at own warehouse</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Access goods at any time</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Hold billing process until the goods are withdrawn from the warehouse</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Return goods to the supplier if they are not needed</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Streamline procurement processes in an efficient and cost-effective manner</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Ensure highly automated processes</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce manual effort greatly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">View analytical list page: Monitor purchase order items</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>供应商寄售 (2LG)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过使用寄售流程进行采购，供应商将提供物料并将其存储在采购方的地点。在从寄售库存中提取物料之前，供应商一直维护物料的法定所有者。只有在领料时才需要支付寄售库存。因此，会定期通知供应商寄售库存领料。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理库存</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">结算寄售</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio50e80a70f77b4baea4975c8143ff0a66__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">在自己的仓库存储供应商货物</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">随时获取货物</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">暂停开票流程，直到从仓库中提取货物</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">如果不需要，将货物退回给供应商</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">以经济有效的方式简化采购流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确保高度自动化的流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">大幅减少手动工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">查看分析列表页面：监控采购订单项目</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
